# Application stack — AI Support System

npm **workspaces** monorepo (`client`, `server`, `shared`). Package manifests declare semver ranges (`^`); **authoritative installs** are in root `package-lock.json` after `npm install`.

## Repository root

| Package | Declared | Notes |
|--------|----------|--------|
| `concurrently` | `^9.2.1` | Lock: **9.2.1** — runs client + server dev scripts together (`npm run dev`). |

- No root `engines` field in repo today; consider adding `engines.node` aligned with **Vite** and **Node** support below.

